Package: fastDiversity
Type: Package
Title: Simple and Quick Diversity Calculations for Biallelic Data
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R: person(given = c("Eilish", "S."), family = "McMaster",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "emcm4052@uni.sydney.edu.au")
Description: Addresses shortcomings in existing methods, which often necessitate specific data structures and file types, and are occasionally no longer maintained. Offers essential functions for basic population genomic analysis in a format compatible with any SNP data in biallelic 0,1,2 (aa, aA, AA) format (e.g., DArTseq), thereby saving time compared to alternative approaches.
